"trained":false,"bonus":0},"linguistique":{"trained":false,"bonus":0},"vigilance":{"trained":true,"bonus":0},"empathie":{"trained":true,"bonus":1},"perception":{"trained":true,"bonus":2},"intimidation":{"trained":false,"bonus":0},"dissimulation":{"trained":false,"bonus":0},"commandement":{"trained":false,"bonus":1},"seduction":{"trained":true,"bonus":2},"baratin":{"trained":true,"bonus":2},"psychologie":{"trained":false,"bonus":1},"marchandage":{"trained":false,"bonus":1},"representation":{"trained":false,"bonus":0}},"saves":{"reflexes":{"base":1,"temp":0},"robustesse":{"base":1,"temp":0},"volonte":{"base":1,"temp":0}},"ca":{"base":12,"armure":1,"bouclier":0,"bonusVigueur":-2,"temp":2},"attackBonuses":{"mainNue":{"bonus":-4},"armeBlanche":{"bonus":-4},"armeDeJet":{"bonus":-4},"armeExotique":{"bonus":1},"armeADistance":{"bonus":6}},"or":0},"items":[{"_id":"iEph000000000001","name":"Arc","type":"weapon","img":"icons/weapons/bows/shortbow-recurve-yellow.webp","system":{"attBonus":10,"damage":"1d10+2","critical":"19/x3","typeDamage":"Pénétrant","portee":25,"hasPortee":true,"munitions":25,"description":"","consumable":true}},{"_id":"iEph000000000002","name":"Gamel, cuillère","type":"equipment","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"quantity":1,"description":"","consumable":false}},{"_id":"iEph000000000003","name":"Outre à eau (1l)","type":"equipment","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"quantity":1,"description":"","consumable":true}},{"_id":"iEph000000000004","name":"Sac de couchage","type":"equipment","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"quantity":1,"description":"","consumable":false}},{"_id":"iEph000000000005","name":"Silex à amadou","type":"equipment","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"quantity":1,"description":"","consumable":true}},{"_id":"iEph000000000006","name":"Rations","type":"equipment","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"quantity":2,"description":"Rations de voyage (2 jours)","consumable":true}},{"_id":"iEph000000000007","name":"Cape cirée noire","type":"equipment","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"quantity":1,"description":"","consumable":false}},{"_id":"iEph000000000008","name":"Carquois (25 flèches)","type":"equipment","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"quantity":25,"description":"Flèches standard","consumable":true}},{"_id":"iEph000000000009","name":"Flèches de feu","type":"equipment","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"quantity":0,"description":"Flèches incendiaires","consumable":true}},{"_id":"iEph000000000010","name":"Aura d'Aphrodite","type":"advantage","img":"icons/svg/aura.svg","system":{"cout":-3,"description":"<p>L'aura divine d'Aphrodite enveloppe Éphise, lui conférant un charme surnaturel irrésistible. Les personnes à proximité ressentent une attirance instinctive, facilitant les interactions sociales et la persuasion.</p>"},"effects":[{"_id":"eEph000000000001","name":"Aura d'Aphrodite","icon":"icons/svg/aura.svg","transfer":true,"disabled":false,"changes":[{"key":"system.skills.seduction.bonus","mode":2,"value":"3","priority":null},{"key":"system.skills.baratin.bonus","mode":2,"value":"2","priority":null},{"key":"system.skills.empathie.bonus","mode":2,"value":"1","priority":null}]}]},{"_id":"iEph000000000011","name":"Beauté d'Aphrodite","type":"advantage","img":"icons/svg/angel.svg","system":{"cout":-1,"description":"<p>Éphise possède une beauté héritée de la déesse Aphrodite elle-même. Ses traits sont d'une perfection surnaturelle qui inspire l'admiration et la confiance.</p>"},"effects":[{"_id":"eEph000000000002","name":"Beauté d'Aphrodite","icon":"icons/svg/angel.svg","transfer":true,"disabled":false,"changes":[{"key":"system.skills.representation.bonus","mode":2,"value":"2","priority":null}]}]},{"_id":"iEph000000000012","name":"Rage d'Arès","type":"advantage","img":"icons/svg/combat.svg","system":{"cout":-1,"description":"<p>La fureur du dieu de la guerre coule dans les veines d'Éphise. En combat, une rage divine peut s'emparer de lui, décuplant sa férocité et sa puissance de frappe.</p>"},"effects":[{"_id":"eEph000000000003","name":"Rage d'Arès","icon":"icons/svg/combat.svg","transfer":true,"disabled":false,"changes":[{"key":"system.skills.combatMainNue.bonus","mode":2,"value":"2","priority":null},{"key":"system.skills.intimidation.bonus","mode":2,"value":"1","priority":null}]}]},{"_id":"iEph000000000013","name":"Présence d'Aphrodite","type":"disadvantage","img":"icons/svg/eye.svg","system":{"cout":2,"description":"<p>La présence divine d'Aphrodite qui habite Éphise attire inévitablement les regards et les convoitises. Impossible de passer inaperçu dans une foule, les jalousies et les désirs non sollicités compliquent sa vie quotidienne.</p>"},"effects":[{"_id":"eEph000000000004","name":"Présence d'Aphrodite","icon":"icons/svg/eye.svg","transfer":true,"disabled":false,"changes":[{"key":"system.skills.discretion.bonus","mode":2,"value":"-3","priority":null},{"key":"system.skills.dissimulation.bonus","mode":2,"value":"-2","priority":null}]}]},{"_id":"iEph000000000014","name":"Dette ++","type":"disadvantage","img":"icons/svg/downgrade.svg","system":{"cout":3,"description":"<p>Éphise croule sous des dettes considérables contractées auprès de créanciers puissants. Cette pression financière limite ses ressources, ses possibilités d'achat, et l'expose à des représailles si les remboursements tardent.</p>"},"effects":[{"_id":"eEph000000000005","name":"Dette ++","icon":"icons/svg/downgrade.svg","transfer":true,"disabled":false,"changes":[{"key":"system.skills.marchandage.bonus","mode":2,"value":"-2","priority":null}]}]},{"_id":"iEph000000000015","name":"Beauté divine","type":"blessing","img":"icons/svg/sun.svg","system":{"effect":"-1 difficulté jets de charisme","description":"<p>Bénédiction accordée par Aphrodite. La grâce divine facilite tous les jets liés au charisme, réduisant la difficulté des interactions sociales.</p>"},"effects":[{"_id":"eEph000000000006","name":"Beauté divine","icon":"icons/svg/sun.svg","transfer":true,"disabled":false,"changes":[{"key":"system.abilities.cha.mod","mode":2,"value":"1","priority":null}]}]},{"_id":"iEph000000000016","name":"Corps d'Arès","type":"blessing","img":"icons/svg/fire-shield.svg","system":{"effect":"+2 CA (compris dans la base)","description":"<p>Bénédiction du dieu de la guerre. Le corps d'Éphise est renforcé par la vigueur divine d'Arès, lui octroyant une protection naturelle supplémentaire en combat.</p>"},"effects":[{"_id":"eEph000000000007","name":"Corps d'Arès","icon":"icons/svg/fire-shield.svg","transfer":true,"disabled":false,"changes":[{"key":"system.ca.temp","mode":2,"value":"2","priority":null}]}]}],"effects":[]}
{"_id":"aPnj000000000002","name":"Général Xanthos","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/combat.svg","system":{"description":"<p>Général au service d'Agamemnon. Homme mystérieux qui commande la légion de la chouette. Distribue les oboles aux recrues avant de disparaître dans un sifflement.</p>","taille":"1m85","type":"Humain - Officier","pv":{"value":55,"max":55},"abilities":{"for":{"value":16,"mod":3},"dex":{"value":14,"mod":2},"con":{"value":16,"mod":3},"int":{"value":15,"mod":2},"ast":{"value":14,"mod":2},"cha":{"value":13,"mod":1}},"ca":{"value":18},"initiative":{"value":4},"attaque":{"value":8},"notes":"<p><strong>Rôle :</strong> Commandant de la légion de la chouette (temple de Déméter).</p><p><strong>Comportement :</strong> Apparaît et disparaît sans prévenir. Donne des ordres clairs et concis. Ne tolère pas la désobéissance.</p><p><strong>Lien avec les PJ :</strong> A donné l'obole de la chouette au groupe.</p>"},"items":[{"_id":"iXan000000000001","name":"Épée longue","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"attBonus":11,"damage":"1d8+3","critical":"19/x2","typeDamage":"Tranchant","portee":0,"hasPortee":false,"munitions":0,"description":"","consumable":false}},{"_id":"iXan000000000002","name":"Armure de bronze","type":"equipment","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"quantity":1,"description":"Armure de plaques en bronze, gravée de motifs de chouettes.","consumable":false}}],"effects":[]}
{"_id":"aPnj000000000003","name":"Agloros","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/eye.svg","system":{"description":"<p>Représentante de Ménéster et des intérêts d'Athènes au sein de l'alliance. Porte le symbole d'Athéna. Un étrange reflet argenté émane d'elle par moments. Diplomate aguerrie, elle cache ses véritables motivations derrière une façade polie.</p>","taille":"1m70","type":"Humain - Diplomate","pv":{"value":28,"max":28},"abilities":{"for":{"value":10,"mod":0},"dex":{"value":12,"mod":1},"con":{"value":11,"mod":0},"int":{"value":17,"mod":3},"ast":{"value":16,"mod":3},"cha":{"value":18,"mod":4}},"ca":{"value":12},"initiative":{"value":4},"attaque":{"value":2},"notes":"<p><strong>Rôle :</strong> Émissaire d'Athènes dans l'alliance.</p><p><strong>Comportement :</strong> Polie mais évasive. <em>Elle ment</em> quand elle parle des bienfaits de l'alliance — lui reposer la question plus tard. N'apprécie pas qu'on parle des problèmes du peuple en public.</p><p><strong>Reflet argenté :</strong> Lien possible avec Athéna ? À surveiller.</p><p><strong>Secret :</strong> Ses motivations réelles restent inconnues.</p>"},"items":[{"_id":"iAgl000000000001","name":"Dague cérémonielle","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"attBonus":3,"damage":"1d4+1","critical":"19/x2","typeDamage":"Perforant","portee":0,"hasPortee":false,"munitions":0,"description":"","consumable":false}}],"effects":[]}
{"_id":"aPnj000000000004","name":"Prince Égisthe","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/shield.svg","system":{"description":"<p>Prince allié de l'alliance, posté au temple de Déméter avec Agloros. Homme bourru et direct, il s'entend bien avec les combattants francs. Connaît le terrain autour du camp ennemi.</p>","taille":"1m80","type":"Humain - Noble guerrier","pv":{"value":42,"max":42},"abilities":{"for":{"value":17,"mod":3},"dex":{"value":13,"mod":1},"con":{"value":15,"mod":2},"int":{"value":12,"mod":1},"ast":{"value":11,"mod":0},"cha":{"value":14,"mod":2}},"ca":{"value":17},"initiative":{"value":1},"attaque":{"value":7},"notes":"<p><strong>Rôle :</strong> Prince commandant les troupes au temple de Déméter.</p><p><strong>Comportement :</strong> Bourru, direct, aime se battre. Devient \"BROS\" facilement avec les combattants francs (ex: Xenos).</p><p><strong>Intel :</strong> Connaît les emplacements des patrouilleurs ennemis et la disposition de la muraille en bois du camp cible.</p>"},"items":[{"_id":"iEgi000000000001","name":"Lance de guerre","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"attBonus":10,"damage":"1d8+4","critical":"20/x3","typeDamage":"Perforant","portee":0,"hasPortee":false,"munitions":0,"description":"","consumable":false}},{"_id":"iEgi000000000002","name":"Bouclier rond","type":"equipment","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"quantity":1,"description":"Bouclier en bois cerclé de bronze.","consumable":false}}],"effects":[]}
{"_id":"aPnj000000000005","name":"Darla","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/sun.svg","system":{"description":"<p>Vieille dame croisée au marché, agressée par des voyous alors qu'elle distribuait de la nourriture. Dégage une aura divine que certains perçoivent parfois. Pourrait être un avatar d'<strong>Hécate</strong>, déesse titanide des carrefours, de la magie, des choix et de la lune.</p>","taille":"1m55","type":"??? - Avatar divin ?","pv":{"value":15,"max":15},"abilities":{"for":{"value":8,"mod":-1},"dex":{"value":10,"mod":0},"con":{"value":10,"mod":0},"int":{"value":20,"mod":5},"ast":{"value":22,"mod":6},"cha":{"value":18,"mod":4}},"ca":{"value":10},"initiative":{"value":6},"attaque":{"value":0},"notes":"<p><strong>Identité secrète :</strong> Probablement Hécate, déesse des carrefours, de la magie, des choix et de la lune.</p><p><strong>Aura :</strong> Dégage une aura divine perceptible par certains — repérée parfois comme Hécate.</p><p><strong>Comportement :</strong> Bienveillante, nourrit les démunis. A offert un repas aux PJ. A dit : <em>\"Aux dieux et à ceux qui pensent aux petits / à la fin de cette guerre\"</em>.</p><p><strong>Attention :</strong> Ses statistiques apparentes cachent sans doute sa vraie puissance. Ne pas sous-estimer.</p>"},"items":[],"effects":[]}
{"_id":"aPnj000000000006","name":"Thersandre","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"description":"<p>Se présente comme le véritable roi de Thèbes. Prétend que son cousin Laodamas a dupé les soldats pour usurper le pouvoir. Organise l'offensive en trois fronts pour reprendre la cité.</p>","taille":"1m78","type":"Humain - Prétendant au trône","pv":{"value":38,"max":38},"abilities":{"for":{"value":14,"mod":2},"dex":{"value":12,"mod":1},"con":{"value":13,"mod":1},"int":{"value":16,"mod":3},"ast":{"value":14,"mod":2},"cha":{"value":17,"mod":3}},"ca":{"value":16},"initiative":{"value":3},"attaque":{"value":6},"notes":"<p><strong>Rôle :</strong> Meneur de l'assaut sur Thèbes, se dit roi légitime.</p><p><strong>Plan d'attaque :</strong> 3 places fortes à prendre. L'une d'elles cache Laodamas et le sceptre de régence.</p><p><strong>Répartition :</strong></p><ul><li>Chouette (Xanthos) → Temple de Déméter</li><li>Cheval (Ménélas) → Au temps de Poséidon</li><li>Lyon (Agamemnon) → Reste sur place</li></ul><p><strong>Fiabilité :</strong> Ses motivations semblent sincères mais à vérifier.</p>"},"items":[{"_id":"iThr000000000001","name":"Épée royale","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"attBonus":8,"damage":"1d8+3","critical":"19/x2","typeDamage":"Tranchant","portee":0,"hasPortee":false,"munitions":0,"description":"","consumable":false}}],"effects":[]}
{"_id":"aPnj000000000007","name":"Soldat thébain","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/combat.svg","system":{"description":"<p>Soldat de garnison défendant les fortifications de Thèbes sous les ordres de Laodamas. Entraîné mais démoralisé par les mois de siège.</p>","taille":"1m75","type":"Humain - Soldat","pv":{"value":18,"max":18},"abilities":{"for":{"value":14,"mod":2},"dex":{"value":12,"mod":1},"con":{"value":13,"mod":1},"int":{"value":10,"mod":0},"ast":{"value":10,"mod":0},"cha":{"value":9,"mod":-1}},"ca":{"value":15},"initiative":{"value":1},"attaque":{"value":4},"notes":"<p><strong>Tactique :</strong> Combat en formation. Essaie de rester groupé avec d'autres soldats. Fuit si isolé et blessé sous 50% PV.</p>"},"items":[{"_id":"iSol000000000001","name":"Lance","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"attBonus":4,"damage":"1d8+2","critical":"20/x3","typeDamage":"Perforant","portee":0,"hasPortee":false,"munitions":0,"description":"","consumable":false}},{"_id":"iSol000000000002","name":"Glaive court","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"attBonus":4,"damage":"1d6+2","critical":"19/x2","typeDamage":"Tranchant","portee":0,"hasPortee":false,"munitions":0,"description":"","consumable":false}},{"_id":"iSol000000000003","name":"Bouclier et armure de cuir","type":"equipment","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"quantity":1,"description":"Armure légère en cuir avec bouclier rond en bois.","consumable":false}}],"effects":[]}
{"_id":"aPnj000000000008","name":"Bandit de grand chemin","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/skull.svg","system":{"description":"<p>Brigand profitant du chaos de la guerre pour détrousser voyageurs et réfugiés sur les routes entre les cités.</p>","taille":"1m72","type":"Humain - Bandit","pv":{"value":12,"max":12},"abilities":{"for":{"value":12,"mod":1},"dex":{"value":14,"mod":2},"con":{"value":11,"mod":0},"int":{"value":10,"mod":0},"ast":{"value":12,"mod":1},"cha":{"value":8,"mod":-1}},"ca":{"value":13},"initiative":{"value":3},"attaque":{"value":3},"notes":"<p><strong>Tactique :</strong> Embuscade, supériorité numérique. Fuit dès que le rapport de force tourne. Ne se bat jamais seul.</p>"},"items":[{"_id":"iBan000000000001","name":"Dague rouillée","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"attBonus":3,"damage":"1d4+1","critical":"19/x2","typeDamage":"Perforant","portee":0,"hasPortee":false,"munitions":0,"description":"","consumable":false}},{"_id":"iBan000000000002","name":"Fronde","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"attBonus":4,"damage":"1d4+1","critical":"20/x2","typeDamage":"Contondant","portee":15,"hasPortee":true,"munitions":10,"description":"","consumable":true}}],"effects":[]}
{"_id":"aPnj000000000009","name":"Marchand itinérant","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/coins.svg","system":{"description":"<p>Commerçant voyageant entre les cités grecques malgré les dangers de la guerre. Vend provisions, armes de base et rumeurs.</p>","taille":"1m68","type":"Humain - Marchand","pv":{"value":10,"max":10},"abilities":{"for":{"value":9,"mod":-1},"dex":{"value":11,"mod":0},"con":{"value":10,"mod":0},"int":{"value":14,"mod":2},"ast":{"value":15,"mod":2},"cha":{"value":16,"mod":3}},"ca":{"value":10},"initiative":{"value":2},"attaque":{"value":0},"notes":"<p><strong>Commerce :</strong> Peut vendre rations, outils, flèches, herbes médicinales. Prix majorés en zone de guerre (+50%).</p><p><strong>Rumeurs :</strong> Source d'informations sur les mouvements de troupes et les événements dans les cités voisines.</p><p><strong>Comportement :</strong> Avide mais pas stupide. Respecte ceux qui le protègent sur la route.</p>"},"items":[],"effects":[]}
{"_id":"aPnj000000000010","name":"Centaure sauvage","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/pawprint.svg","system":{"description":"<p>Mi-homme mi-cheval, ce centaure vit dans les forêts et collines loin des cités. Farouche et territorial, il peut être raisonné si on fait preuve de respect envers la nature et les anciens dieux.</p>","taille":"2m20","type":"Créature mythologique","pv":{"value":40,"max":40},"abilities":{"for":{"value":20,"mod":5},"dex":{"value":16,"mod":3},"con":{"value":18,"mod":4},"int":{"value":10,"mod":0},"ast":{"value":14,"mod":2},"cha":{"value":8,"mod":-1}},"ca":{"value":16},"initiative":{"value":5},"attaque":{"value":9},"notes":"<p><strong>Capacités spéciales :</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Charge :</strong> Si le centaure se déplace d'au moins 10m en ligne droite, son attaque de lance inflige +1d6 dégâts supplémentaires.</li><li><strong>Piétinement :</strong> Peut attaquer avec ses sabots en bonus (1d6+5 contondant) contre un ennemi au sol.</li><li><strong>Vitesse :</strong> Déplacement double d'un humain normal.</li></ul><p><strong>Comportement :</strong> Territorial. Attaque si on pénètre dans son domaine sans permission. Peut être apaisé par un jet de CHA ou un tribut de nourriture/vin.</p>"},"items":[{"_id":"iCen000000000001","name":"Lance de bois durci","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"attBonus":9,"damage":"1d8+5","critical":"20/x3","typeDamage":"Perforant","portee":0,"hasPortee":false,"munitions":0,"description":"","consumable":false}},{"_id":"iCen000000000002","name":"Sabots","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"attBonus":9,"damage":"1d6+5","critical":"20/x2","typeDamage":"Contondant","portee":0,"hasPortee":false,"munitions":0,"description":"Attaque bonus contre un ennemi au sol.","consumable":false}},{"_id":"iCen000000000003","name":"Arc de chasse","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"attBonus":7,"damage":"1d8+3","critical":"20/x3","typeDamage":"Pénétrant","portee":20,"hasPortee":true,"munitions":12,"description":"","consumable":true}}],"effects":[]}
